            "review_title": "Review at Gatosano Danang",
            "review_text": "DIEZONERADIO\nTokyo Prefecture, Japan4 contributions\n0\nDanang Music Lovers\nSep 2024 • Friends\nIn Da Nang, Vietnam, you can enjoy the music scene at GATOSANO, which can be found as you venture further inland from the beach. Get the latest information for tonight! Here, you can also experience some good groove! Amazing!\nI'm moving now, so it's like searching around like in Dragon Quest, it's fun!\n\nベトナムダナンの音遊びは、ビーチから奥に進むと現れるGATOSANOで\n今夜の情報をゲット！ここでもgoodgrooveを体感できる！\n最高！\n\n今は引越ししているので、探してみると楽しいよ！\nRead more\nWritten September 8, 2024",
